**Deviations and unfinished**
- **Dart not run.** The orchestrator needs to run the Dart lane.
- **`gi_*` not covered.** 8.5.3 defers `gi_*` introspection, so on a generator expression these attributes raise AttributeError like on any generator here, which differs from CPython. I didn't write a source test for it because it can't match CPython's output.
- **Close-on-collection excluded.** CPython closes the inner generator when a generator expression is closed and dropped; this runtime doesn't (ruling 6), so I kept that case out of the test programs.
